{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Chef Hates Me</strong><br><i>A chaotic isometric PvP kitchen showdown where sabotage is always on the menu.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the heat of the kitchen in <strong>My Chef Hates Me</strong> \u2013 a local PvP action game where two players are roped together (literally) and locked in a culinary duel of trust, betrayal, and burnt souffl\u00e9s. One plays the <i>Intern</i>, desperately trying to cook and deliver orders. The other? The <i>Chef</i>, doing everything they can to sabotage it all\u2026 without making it <i>too</i> obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2.5D isometric kitchen, movement and cooperation are twisted by a rope mechanic that links players together, turning every step, throw, and explosion into a slapstick struggle. Swing your partner into boiling soup, trip them while they plate a dish, or sabotage equipment while pretending to &quot;help.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the Intern rise to the occasion and deliver the food on time?<br>Or will the Chef's schemes bring the kitchen to complete disaster?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801800?t=1758368511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801800/5ec67e4350e2f33e0910cdfee10cf70400a86257/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758368511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801800/4d301cb3ed523cfedeced799482ae547506c4b8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758368511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801800/4d301cb3ed523cfedeced799482ae547506c4b8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758368511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"desc